	)
	(text "v0.1.1\n- Fix for BNC footprint swapping signal and ground.\n- Fix for OPA990 footprint, rotating three pins.\n- Fix for mislabeling 1uF 2220 switching cap. This should be 2.2uF.\n- Fix for bad ground isolation for current sensors.\n- Fix for ERROR LED being hooked up to USB_DP and CAN1_TD pin.\n\nv0.2.0 (summer 2023)\n- Revised component symbol->footprint->model listings.\n- Updated component suppliers.\n- Swapped mounting holes to M3.\n- Added I/O power fuse.\n- Swapped I/O connectors to XT60PW.\n- Removed heatsink and some thermal jumpers.\n- Added HF low uF caps on I/O to remove switching noise.\n- Added CAN circuitry.\n- Removed BNC.\n\nv0.3.0rc (summer 2024)\n- Updated perf specs (see converter sch).\n- Convert Nucleo to bare chip. Upgraded perf chip.\n- Temperature monitoring circuit for high risk components.\n- Antisurge snubber protection.\n- Fan header and mounts for active cooling.\n- Heatsink mounts for passive cooling.\n- Updated connectors.\n- Hit board size, cost target of 75x50 mm^{2}, <75$/board.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
